# CLAUDE.md — {FIRM NAME}

Copy this into the root of your firm's working repo as `CLAUDE.md`, replace every {PLACEHOLDER}, and delete sections that don't apply. This file is context an agent reads every session — keep it short, factual, and current.

## Who we are

{FIRM NAME}, public practice, {CITY} {STATE}. Work is predominantly {compilation / tax / advisory mix}. Clients are {typical client profile, e.g. trading SMEs $1m–$20m turnover, trusts and bucket companies, a handful of SMSFs}.

